  "student_passage": "Our class (1) ____ (visit) a small park last Thursday. There were many (2) ____ (child) near the lake, but our group went to a quieter place behind the trees. Our teacher carried a bag of drawing paper. Ben thanked (3) ____ (she) for bringing extra pencils because he had left his own at home.\n\nWe walked (4) ____ (slow) along the path. One tree was much (5) ____ (big) than the others. We stopped beside it and began drawing. Then a strong wind took Lily's cap into one (6) ____ the branches. She could see it, but she could not reach it. Ben was interested in (7) ____ (take) pictures of the trees, so he still had his camera in his hands. He put it away and went to ask a park worker for help.\n\nThe worker looked (8) ____ a long stick in a nearby shed. Lily was the (9) ____ (small) person in our group, so nobody asked her to climb the tree. A few minutes later, the cap was back. We took a group photograph at (10) ____ same place before leaving.",
