  "filled_passage": "Our class (1) visited (visit) a small park last Thursday. There were many (2) children (child) near the lake, but our group went to a quieter place behind the trees. Our teacher carried a bag of drawing paper. Ben thanked (3) her (she) for bringing extra pencils because he had left his own at home.\n\nWe walked (4) slowly (slow) along the path. One tree was much (5) bigger (big) than the others. We stopped beside it and began drawing. Then a strong wind took Lily's cap into one (6) of the branches. She could see it, but she could not reach it. Ben was interested in (7) taking (take) pictures of the trees, so he still had his camera in his hands. He put it away and went to ask a park worker for help.\n\nThe worker looked (8) for a long stick in a nearby shed. Lily was the (9) smallest (small) person in our group, so nobody asked her to climb the tree. A few minutes later, the cap was back. We took a group photograph at (10) the same place before leaving.",
